<doc id="165068" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=165068" title="Sarah Bernhardt">
Sarah Bernhardt

Sarah Bernhardt (]; lair Henriette-Rosine Bernard; 22 utawa 23 Oktober 1844 – 26 Maret 1923) yaiku aktris panggung Prancis sing mbintangi drama-drama Prancis sing paling misuwur ing pungkasan abad kaping 19 lan wiwitan abad kaping 20, kaya ta &lt;a href="La%20Dame%20Aux%20Camelias"&gt;La Dame Aux Camelias&lt;/a&gt; dening &lt;a href="Alexandre%20Dumas%2C%20fils"&gt;Alexandre Dumas, fils&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;a href="Ruy%20Blas"&gt;Ruy Blas&lt;/a&gt; dening &lt;a href="Victor%20Hugo"&gt;Victor Hugo&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;a href="F%C3%A9dora"&gt;Fédora&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="La%20Tosca"&gt;La Tosca&lt;/a&gt; dening &lt;a href="Victorien%20Sardou"&gt;Victorien Sardou&lt;/a&gt;; lan &lt;a href="L%27Aiglon"&gt;L'Aiglon&lt;/a&gt; dening &lt;a href="Edmond%20Rostand"&gt;Edmond Rostand&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké uga main peran lanang, kaya ta &lt;a href="Pang%C3%A9ran%20Hamlet"&gt;Hamlet&lt;/a&gt; karangane &lt;a href="William%20Shakespeare"&gt;Shakespeare&lt;/a&gt;. Rostand nyebat dhéwéké "ratu pose lan putri gèstur", nalika Hugo muji "swara emasé". Dhéwéké nglakoni pirang-pirang tur teater ing saindenging jagad, lan minangka salah sawijining aktris sing misuwur sing nggawe rekaman swara lan mbintangi film.
