<doc id="169566" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=169566" title="Thukpa">
Thukpa

 Thukpa (Tibetan: ཐུག་ པ ; &lt;a href="Abjad%20Fon%C3%A8tik%20Internasional"&gt;IPA&lt;/a&gt;: /tʰu(k̚)ˀ˥˥.pə˥˥/) ya iku sawijining sop mi &lt;a href="Tibet"&gt;tibetan&lt;/a&gt;, sing asalé ing sisih wétan &lt;a href="Tibet"&gt;Tibet&lt;/a&gt;. Amdo thukpa (utamané thenthuk) minangka jinis sing misuwur ing antarané masarakat Tibet lan wong Himalayan ing &lt;a href="N%C3%A9pal"&gt;Nepal&lt;/a&gt;. Panganan kasebut uga dikonsumsi ing wilayah &lt;a href="%20Sikkim"&gt;Sikkim&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%20Darjeeling"&gt;Darjeeling&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%20Kalimpong"&gt;Kalimpong&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="%20Arunachal%20Pradesh"&gt;Arunachal Pradesh&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;. Suguhan iki uga misuwur ing wilayah &lt;a href="%20Ladakh"&gt;Ladakh&lt;/a&gt; lan tlatah &lt;a href="%20Himachal%20Pradesh"&gt;Himachal Pradesh&lt;/a&gt;. Thukpa uga dipangan ing Bhutan, yaiku jinis bubur. &lt;a href="http%3A//www.drukgirl.com/thukpa-the-himalayan-porridge-recipe"&gt;[2&lt;/a&gt;] Ana macem-macem jinis thukpa ing tradhisi Tibet, kalebu: 
<ul>
<li>Thenthuk (&lt;a href="Tibetan%20script"&gt;Tibetan&lt;/a&gt;: འཐེན་ཐུག་; &lt;a href="Wylie%20transliteration"&gt;Wylie&lt;/a&gt;: 'then thug</li>
<li>Gyathuk (&lt;a href="Tibetan%20script"&gt;Tibetan&lt;/a&gt;: རྒྱ་ཐུག་; &lt;a href="Wylie%20transliteration"&gt;Wylie&lt;/a&gt;: rgya thug): Mie Cina</li>
<li>Nepali (Nepali)</li>
<li>Pathug (&lt;a href="Tibetan%20script"&gt;Tibetan&lt;/a&gt;: བག་ཐུག་; &lt;a href="Wylie%20transliteration"&gt;Wylie&lt;/a&gt;: bag thug): Mie sing &lt;a href="Gnocchi"&gt;dicenthang nganggo&lt;/a&gt; tangan (kaya &lt;a href="gnocchi"&gt;gnocchi&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Drethug (&lt;a href="Tibetan%20script"&gt;Tibetan&lt;/a&gt;: འབྲས་ཐུག་; &lt;a href="Wylie%20transliteration"&gt;Wylie&lt;/a&gt;: 'bras thug)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Étimologi</h2>
Étimologi.
Thukpa wis diterangaké minangka "tembung Tibet umum kanggo sup utawa godhog sing digabungaké karo mi." 
<h2>Thukpa Nepal</h2>
Thukpa Nepal.
Thukpa versi Nepal akéh kena pengaruh saka rasa Nepal lan mulané ngemot lombok bubuk, masala (biasané garam masala), sing nggawé anget lan pedhes karo rasa kari Nepali sing dominan. 
